                    <p>
                        The Fifth article in the Mesopotamian Influence edition of BET KANU Magazine explores the Sexagesimal Number System of the Babylonians — One of the most powerful number systems in history. It examines how the system worked? Why base-60? AndLegacy of the Babylonian System.
                    </p>
